eline Detail (Receiver / Scraper / Processor / Exporter)","type":"data","query":"timeseries {accepted=sum(otelcol_receiver_accepted_metric_points)}\n| fieldsAdd type=\"receiver\"\n| append [\n    timeseries {refused=sum(otelcol_receiver_refused_metric_points)}\n    | fieldsAdd type=\"receiver\"\n  ]\n| append [\n    timeseries {receiver_failed=sum(otelcol_receiver_failed_metric_points)}\n    | fieldsAdd type=\"receiver\"\n  ]\n| append [\n    timeseries {scraped=sum(otelcol_scraper_scraped_metric_points)}\n    | fieldsAdd type=\"scraper\"\n  ]\n| append [\n    timeseries {scrape_errors=sum(otelcol_scraper_errored_metric_points)}\n    | fieldsAdd type=\"scraper\"\n  ]\n| append [\n    timeseries {filtered=sum(otelcol_processor_filter_datapoints.filtered)}\n    | fieldsAdd type=\"processor\"\n  ]\n| append [\n    timeseries {sent=sum(otelcol_exporter_sent_metric_points)}\n    | fieldsAdd type=\"exporter\"\n  ]","visualization":"lineChart","visualizationSettings":{"autoSelectVisualization":true},"querySettings":{"maxResultRecords":1000,"defaultScanLimitGbytes":500,"maxResultMegaBytes":100,"defaultSamplingRatio":10,"enableSampling":false},"davis":{"enabled":false,"davisVisualization":{"isAvailable":true}},"timeframe":{"tileTimeframeEnabled":false,"tileTimeframe":{"from":"now()-6h","to":"now()"}}},"12":{"type":"markdown","content":"---\n## 🌐 Network & Throughput\n_The Bindplane OTel collector does not emit host network I/O metrics directly — this section uses the collector's own data-volume and export-queue/backpressure metrics as the network health proxy._"},"13":{"title":"📦 Data Volume by Telemetry Type (bytes)","type":"data","query":"timeseries log_bytes = sum(otelcol_processor_throughputmeasurement_log_data_size), metric_bytes = sum(otelcol_processor_throughputmeasurement_metric_data_size), by:{host.name}","visualization":"areaChart","visualizationSettings":{"autoSelectVisualization":false},"querySettings":{"maxResultRecords":1000,"defaultScanLimitGbytes":500,"maxRes